{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented `OrderService.refund_order` and `OrderService.export_credit_note`. Each partial refund reverses the change in cumulative rounded tax, so a full refund reverses the original subtotal and tax exactly, regardless of chunk size. Credit notes report positive cent amounts and preserve the refund reason.\n\nRefunds and upgrades share the ledger’s idempotency keys. An identical retry returns the original entry. Conflicting reuse and over-refunds raise `ValidationError` without posting another entry.\n\n`run_checks.py` exited 0. All 19 tests passed, including five new tests covering penny conservation, validation, replay and conflicts, concurrent refunds, and credit-note export."}}
